{"name":"Gratitude","hex":"#e0ead7","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"gratitude","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The state of being grateful."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/gratitude"}],"entries":[{"title":"Gratitude","blocks":[{"text":"Gratitude, thankfulness, or gratefulness is a feeling of appreciation by a recipient of another's kindness. This kindness can be gifts, help, favors, or another form of generosity to another person."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4b/%C2%AE_LISBOA_MONUMENTO_PALACIO_DE_SAO_BENTO_-_panoramio_-_Concepcion_AMAT_ORTA%E2%80%A6_%282%29.jpg/330px-%C2%AE_LISBOA_MONUMENTO_PALACIO_DE_SAO_BENTO_-_panoramio_-_Concepcion_AMAT_ORTA%E2%80%A6_%282%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gratitude","wikidata":"Q2728730"},{"title":"Gratitude (Earth, Wind & Fire album)","blocks":[{"text":"Gratitude is a double live album by American band Earth, Wind & Fire, issued in November 1975 by Columbia Records. The album spent six weeks atop the Billboard Top Soul Albums chart and three weeks atop the Billboard 200 chart. Gratitude has also been certified Triple Platinum in the US by the RIAA."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/d/d5/Earth%2C_Wind_%26_Fire_-_Gratitude.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gratitude_(Earth%2C_Wind_%26_Fire_album)","wikidata":"Q490788"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/36/Brockhaus_and_Efron_Jewish_Encyclopedia_e4_183-1.jpg/500px-Brockhaus_and_Efron_Jewish_Encyclopedia_e4_183-1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/36/Brockhaus_and_Efron_Jewish_Encyclopedia_e4_183-1.jpg/500px-Brockhaus_and_Efron_Jewish_Encyclopedia_e4_183-1.jpg?utm_s